Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:08.46,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}The hands will never surpass the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.69,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Unless you cultivate the "eyes" \Nto discern good from bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:11.69,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(272,1)\fnTimes New Roman\an8\fs20\shad0\c&H4C87B7&\b1\bord0\pos(566,26)}Class Check\N\N{\c&H262D2B&\bord1\3c&H787885&}~Production~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:11.69,sign_845_4_Correct_Answer__,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(523,1)\pos(510,336)}Correct Answer Waiting Room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:14.70,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,you cannot hope to improve the \N"hands" that create works of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:18.83,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,It's a phrase that's often \Nused among creators,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:21.50,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,but it applies to all kinds of fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.71,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Those with good "eyes" will improve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:27.75,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,far more rapidly than those without!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:44.56,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,When I throw my right horizontal punch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.65,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,he immediately sends a left vertical jab!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:51.03,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori wasn't moving like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:52.48,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,He's improving...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.57,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,by devouring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.66,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What a beautiful way to knock me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.66,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,His face is wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:03.62,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I can hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.04,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Even with Divergent Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:06.96,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.40,Italics,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,He stopped my fist with his forehead \Nbefore it could reach full speed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:19.05,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I want you \Nto devour right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:21.43,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Your Divergent Fist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:23.93,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,is created by your cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:26.85,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,lagging behind your \Nsuperhuman physical prowess,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:29.06,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,when normally it would never lag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.07,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,It's a tricky move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:35.32,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Your average sorcerer wouldn't know what \Nhappened, and they'd be left disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:37.15,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,It carries plenty of force, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.78,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,For opponents on that level, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:43.33,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,But it won't work against special-grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.33,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,What will you do, best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:52.00,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Imbue my full strength with \Ncursed energy at the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:53.09,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:56.42,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,So then why is your cursed energy lagging?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.89,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,It's because you're channeling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:02.64,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:07.10,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, I thought we were talking \Nabout channeling it faster...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:08.94,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,We channel cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.61,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Many sorcerers do this consciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.36,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,"My stomach's full of rage."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:16.53,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,"The blood's boiling in my gut."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:19.15,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,The theory is that cursed energy extracted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:20.61,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,from such negative emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:23.62,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(693,1)\c&H000000&\bord1.5\shad0\b1\pos(322,245)\fs36\t(1236,4321,1 \fs18)\3c&H8E8876&}Curse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:23.24,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,starts in the navel and is \Nchanneled throughout the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:26.12,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,They say it flows from the navel to the chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:30.42,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,then the shoulders, arms, \Nand finally the fists,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:33.13,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,but this perception of \Nthe body as individual parts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:35.63,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,is what delays cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:39.63,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,The idea of channeling cursed \Nenergy isn't wrong in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.22,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,But that's only the first step!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:44.05,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,You can't let yourself remain \Ntoo trapped by that concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:48.14,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,The better the sorcerer, the harder it is \Nto read the flow of their cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.94,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,For a different reason from why yours is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:54.32,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Do we think with our guts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.32,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Do we express anger with our heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:59.90,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:16.21,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,We exist in this world with our entire mind, \Nbody, and soul as one whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:20.72,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,It's such a given that \Neveryone forgets about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.97,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Toudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:32.48,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I think I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.44,Main,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Then no more words are needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:39.03,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I won't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:47.53,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll guide you with my full strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.79,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't die on me, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:52.96,Italics,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Rise up to greater heights!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:16.79,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1398,1)\c&H0F0D09&\3c&HB7BD80&\t(1236,1817,1 \3c&H85A2A4&)\t(1819,2945,1 \3c&H95DED9&)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:31.51,Ep_Title_Shadow,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(528,518)\q2\fscx90\pos(608,305)}Episode 16: Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event - Group Battle 2 -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:31.51,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(528,518)\q2\fscx90\pos(608,305)}Episode 16: Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event - Group Battle 2 -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.59,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:32.56,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Your old fart told you to kill Itadori, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.77,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,This girl has good intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:39.10,Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,No, that was probably Panda-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.27,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:43.57,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You really don't need to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.74,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm out to kill someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:50.20,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Especially that bitch Mai, \Nthe watered-down version of Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:51.45,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.70,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't "What?" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:57.16,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Even Pepper-kun gives slightly \Nbetter responses than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:59.21,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,What, she's not getting mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:02.21,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,But I feel the same way right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:06.59,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I almost forgot. You guys \Nhave your own Pepper-kun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:10.09,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll scrap it and dump it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:13.85,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.90,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Panda-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.82,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It's a cursed corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.48,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.44,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Though it won't be able to move for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:31.91,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Now, who were you calling a Pepper-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.03,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:40.29,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll beat this first-year into cute shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:42.38,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show her how Mai-chan's suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:46.80,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,and teach her all about what it means \Nfor a woman to live as a jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.92,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:49.88,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.61,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You looking for attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:58.39,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You should focus on support \Nand staying hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:00.77,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's just get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:02.69,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,since we're so similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.32,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Damn puppet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.99,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,What do you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.25,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief. What happened \Nto hunting cursed spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.00,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Sword Option:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.38,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Boost On!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:35.43,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Ultra Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.94,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you keep still?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.24,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I need to finish this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:55.20,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather leave him be and go \Nhelp Nobara, but he fires at range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:59.08,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't have information on \NMechamaru, Nishimiya, or Miwa, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.91,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.46,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,What grade are you?
