Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:09.94,sign_12193_114_First_Grade,ScreenToptoBottom,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(274,1)\fscx85\pos(335,168)}Second-Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:09.94,sign_12193_114_First_Grade,ScreenToptoBottom,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(274,1)\fscx85\pos(335,190)}Semi-\N\N\N\N\NSecond-Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:09.94,sign_12193_114_First_Grade,ScreenToptoBottom,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(274,1)\fscx95\pos(335,275.333)}Third-Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.54,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,By my guess, this is where everyone stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.94,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little too much \Nfor Nobara to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:13.80,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think my rating against \Ncursed spirits is needed right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:14.97,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:18.72,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Semi-first-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:20.22,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:21.98,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Ultra Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.15,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,His area of attack is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.57,0:08:34.86,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Heat emission!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:36.95,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,It's a technique with big\Nbuild-up and cool-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:42.12,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,This output is pointless if \NI don't hit its core dead-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.37,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Cursed corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.50,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,That's the generic name \Nfor inanimate objects
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.47,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,that house curses and can\Noperate independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:56.34,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Man-made cursed corpses always have \Na core that serves as their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:06.52,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Panda is the ultimate masterpiece \Nby myself, Yaga Masamichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.48,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,the leading expert on \Npuppeteering cursed techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:12.15,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,He's a cursed corpse born with emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:24.20,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,A cursed corpse mutation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:28.21,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Panda... is not a panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:39.85,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I can't follow his movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:01.49,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I guess if there was another like me, \NI would have at least heard rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:03.49,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,The fact that I haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.33,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,means you're not a cursed corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:09.25,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You're a sorcerer who's remote-controlling \Nthis thing while your main body's elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:13.00,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't mean you should snap over \Nbeing treated like a cursed corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.71,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You don't like being similar to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.80,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You wound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.22,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I think it actually hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:26.43,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Judging from your cursed energy output, \Nyour main body shouldn't be that far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:28.44,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,No, you're just outside the arena, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.31,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Guess there's no point in \Nhunting you down, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:33.27,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You'd just be free to act in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.44,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,So I guess I'll just bust you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:37.95,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be doing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.86,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Heavenly pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.82,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Have you heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:46.16,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like a pact normally \Nforged with oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:50.25,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pact forced upon the body \Nfrom the moment it's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:54.17,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I was born without a right arm \Nor anything below my knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:56.84,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,and I had no sensation from the waist down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:11:00.13,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,My skin is so fragile that\Neven moonlight burns it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:04.10,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,and it constantly feels like needles \Nare stabbing every pore of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.43,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,But in exchange, I've been granted the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:09.23,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,to use cursed techniques over vast distances,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.35,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,as well as immense cursed energy production.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.15,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't ask for any of this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:19.11,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,If I could trade my cursed techniques \Nto have a normal body, I'd gladly do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.41,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,So when I see a cursed corpse like you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:25.87,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,walking around in broad daylight \Nwithout a care instead of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.50,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I just cannot stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.08,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Ultimate Mechamaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:37.50,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Mode: Albatross!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.01,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,That's an incredible \Namount of cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:45.93,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,And given his position, \NNobara's in his line of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.14,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I have to block it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:51.06,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Ultimate Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:06.12,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:09.75,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,No, the very concept of death
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.92,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,doesn't apply to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.92,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You revealed your technique
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.42,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,while boasting about your misfortune, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.09,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Quite the sorcerer thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:27.18,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,It's still alive after taking a hit \Nfrom Ultimate Cannon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:33.98,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'm kind of pissed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:38.98,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,What is that form?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:42.61,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Panda... is not a panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.99,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:54.00,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:12:59.59,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:04.38,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,You have an older brother \Nand an older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.22,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,No, I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.68,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:10.68,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,They're inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.02,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,And why the polite tone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.73,Flashback,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Inside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:16.40,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You'll understand someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.23,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,Those two will always,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:24.15,Flashback,Yaga,0000,0000,0000,,always lend you strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.53,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Sword Option: Ultra Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:40.54,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, a cursed corpse has \Na single core for its heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.09,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But there are three cores inside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:47.01,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,and by switching out which one is \Nthe main core, I can convert my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:51.35,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,There's the Panda core, focused on balance...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:55.52,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,my older brother, Gorilla Core, \Nfocused on power for short, decisive battles...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.77,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,and my bashful older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.36,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,His first attack got my older sister's core,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.11,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,and that last one exhausted the Panda core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:07.74,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I have no choice left but to \Nbeat him with Gorilla Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:19.08,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't pack as much power as Toudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.67,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,But that palm strike just now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:23.09,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,went all the way to my internals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.67,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I guard, I'll still take damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:28.55,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You realized it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:31.26,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,This is Gorilla Mode's special move,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:36.10,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,the unstoppable Drumming Beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:40.19,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,If I take that Drumming Beat \Nto my head or chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.86,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to move Mechamaru anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:47.03,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,My right arm, Sword Option,\Nis no longer functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.61,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fire Ultimate Cannon anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:54.37,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Gorilla Mode pounds through \Ncursed energy like a gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.87,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.75,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I crushed his right arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.21,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,He can't fire off his \Nultimate attack anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:03.17,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,No swords in his left or his mouth, \Nso only ranged blasts left?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.21,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, he shouldn't fire them haphazardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.63,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru believes he failed to finish \Nme with those blasts twice already,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.64,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,despite actually putting two \Nof my cores close to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:18.60,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,This time he'll likely blast my core \Nwith point-blank precision
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.77,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,or try to finish me with a slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.02,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.45,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I have the advantage at close range!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:53.03,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,A tile?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:55.49,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Did he pick it off the roof just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:04.75,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,A distraction, then jet acceleration!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:06.38,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,He's experienced at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.21,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I won't miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.80,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Its core is where its \Ncursed energy is densest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:14.88,Italics,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:26.06,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,You did well, for a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:32.78,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Don't treat me like other cursed corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.11,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I know how to bluff the position of my core \Nwith cursed energy manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:39.33,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already concealing the \Nnumber of cores, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:55.80,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You lost because you \Nunderestimated puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:18:00.85,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't had a single thing in common with \Nanyone around me from the moment I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:04.93,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you and I could \Nunderstand each other in that sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:09.56,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Though I've never once \Nbeen jealous of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.81,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.32,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, humans are creepy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.87,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,They'll risk their lives and fight \Nhard toward their goals,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:23.83,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,then they'll be laid-back or \Nwishy-washy. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:28.58,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I do love those aspects \Nthat I don't have,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:29.79,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,creepy as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.50,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you have your own \Nhardships, too, Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:37.22,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But having more hardships \Ndoesn't make you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:40.51,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's not like we're \Nenemies in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.97,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you a jujutsu \Nsorcerer to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.56,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Because that's the only thing you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.77,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, not that it really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:51.27,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But if you want to make something happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.40,Italics,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:58.28,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:01.16,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Don't waste your powerful moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.28,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,You never know when you'll be facing \Nmore than the single enemy before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.04,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.58,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,don't go thinking someone who can't \Ninstantly state his type of woman
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:12.79,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,can become a full-fledged jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:17.38,Flashback,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru, it's just obligatory, \Nbut I got you these instead of chocolates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:20.34,Flashback,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you liked AA Evoltas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.34,0:19:21.80,Flashback,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.93,Flashback,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:24.81,Flashback,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,But Mai said—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.31,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:47.95,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,together with everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:51.92,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Hm? Say that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:56.80,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if you'll still say you'll \Nhelp me after seeing what I look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:02.68,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You think I'm going to \Nfuss over what you look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:03.97,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.47,0:20:07.51,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.14,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Let me pay you a visit next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.73,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, you damn puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:23.95,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.83,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Lend me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:32.50,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1030,1)\an2\b0\shad2\pos(320,265)\fscx90}Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event Group Battle\NUltimate Mechamaru - Retired
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.51,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:44.09,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,This woman... is incredibly strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.52,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Mechamaru&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:24.57,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru, let Noritoshi know \NUtahime-sensei's calling for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:30.02,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru, give this to Toudou-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.06,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru! Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:36.36,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,This is for Toudou-senpai and Kamo-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:42.80,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you all always go through me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:43.80,Main,Three,0000,0000,0000,,Grk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:48.06,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.80,Flashback,Toudou,0000,0000,0000,,Takada-chan's live-streaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:54.79,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,Ibaragi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:56.98,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,It's Ibara{\i1}ki{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.03,Flashback,Kamo,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:03.76,Italics,Mai&Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Because they're too much trouble, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:11.32,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm honestly still scared of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.87,0:23:17.58,Italics,Three,0000,0000,0000,,But if I said that, I might not \Nbe able to ask him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.23,0:23:20.56,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Mechamaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.92,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:30.31,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Time for our missions!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:31.22,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:32.86,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:42.78,Main,Mechamaru,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it's good \Nthat they can rely on me.
